 "sentences": [
  "Rebecca Clarke was a world-class viola virtuoso.",
  "She became one of London’s first female professional orchestral players.",
  "Born in England, she eventually settled permanently in the United States.",
  "She married composer James Friskin in 1944.",
  "Although her output was not large, her work showed real artistic power.",
  "Her compositions were largely forgotten until interest revived in 1976.",
  "The Rebecca Clarke Society now promotes the study and performance of her music."
